flowchart TB
  A["ТЗ / Contract / Sources"] --> B["Постановка / пределы применимости"]
  B --> C["Test Environment & initial states"]
  C --> D["Sequence / state diagrams"]
  D --> E["Programme: test matrix + thresholds"]
  E --> F["Method: exact steps + evidence"]
  F --> R{"Reviewer approves? "}
  R -->|No| B
  R -->|Yes| G["Implement test code / fixture"]
  G --> H["Run isolated tests"]
  H --> I{"Results complete?"}
  I -->|Evidence missing| J["INCONCLUSIVE / BLOCKED"]
  I -->|Violation| K["FAIL + incident"]
  I -->|All assertions| L["PASS for this TEST-ID"]
  L --> P["Independent POLYGON / version-specific"]
  P --> Q["Human release decision"]
  J --> H
  K --> M["Code correction + new version"]
  M --> H
